      "statement": "Humanoid muscle-curve clips are unsupported because they produce no transform motion on a plain hierarchy, and this is enforced at asset-creation time by CreateAnnotatedClipMenu rejecting Humanoid rigs with a dialog rather than failing later during bake.",
