    {
      "id": "claim_e00897b6540b4f2e87e2ccce953b2359",
      "statement": "Baking is runtime-legal because it uses AnimationClip.SampleAnimation, so pose extraction keeps working in a player build; only validation is editor-only, since curve bindings are unreadable outside the Editor and TryValidateClip therefore returns true unconditionally in a player build.",
