    {
      "id": "claim_3cf39bb6d9784a608da659a00b1efc94",
      "statement": "The rig that a clip is sampled against is derived as the skeleton root's topmost ancestor rather than stored in a field, because an importer writes curve paths relative to the asset's main object and a second serialized field could disagree with the skeleton while a derived value cannot.",
