    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b09a8fa6ebd9447c89469ee1709891e1",
      "statement": "SkeletonAnimation rejects a skeleton root that is a scene object, because the rest pose is read live off the Transforms and a scene rig hands back whatever pose it happens to be animated to, which nothing downstream can detect.",
