      "statement": "SkeletonAnimation treats a missing serialized reference as distinct from null by probing it inside a try/catch for MissingReferenceException, because Unity deliberately reports a missing reference as non-null so that touching it throws a diagnostic, and inspectors reach RootBone and TryValidate on every repaint.",
