      "statement": "GaitPhase reproduces gait_phase.py's rule but deliberately refuses to extrapolate past the first and last footfall, holding the phase and reporting a rate of zero instead, because extrapolating gave the 4.4 seconds of standing before frame 132 of the untrimmed walk1_subject1 clip 2.87 complete gait cycles the character never walked.",
